2026-06-30 18:25:04,105 | INFO | HTTP Request: POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/chat "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
2026-06-30 18:25:04,105 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: We can ensure our solution meets the required security and regulatory standards by leveraging our existing ISO 27001 certification for development, delivery, and operations, which includes privacy information management through our ISO 27701 certification. Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides SecNumCloud-compliant sovereign hosting within the EU, supporting the confidentiality of data. 

For data protection, we implement encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and at rest with AES-256, managed through an EU-based infrastructure. Strict partitioning and logical isolation per client and mission prevent cross-client circulation of data, further enhanced by pseudonymisation and data minimisation practices.

