To maintain the firm's anti-money-laundering obligations, we are familiar with the LCB-FT framework and ensure our solution does not undermine a firm's reporting obligations. Our experience in delivering solutions to clients bound by professional secrecy, including national professional orders, further ensures that we can meet the tender's requirements for strict professional secrecy and confidentiality.
