Our target gross margin for this contract is between 25% and 35%. To achieve this, we select a cost-efficient configuration that balances the need for high-quality service with the requirement to control costs. The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model is identified as the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side, which helps minimize costs while preserving an acceptable margin.

We propose our solution within the budget envelope of €220,000 over 3 years, ensuring a gross margin within our target range while delivering a high-quality service to our client. Our approach optimizes costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service, meeting the tender requirements for data sovereignty, reliability, and sustainability.
